{'symbol': 'J', 'date': '2021-09-21 04:00:00', 'title': "JACOBS SECURES POSITIONS ON TRANSPORT FOR LONDON'S ENGINEERING CONSULTANCY FRAMEWORK", 'text': "DALLAS, SEPT. 21, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JACOBS (NYSE:J) HAS SECURED 13 POSITIONS ON TRANSPORT FOR LONDON 'S (TFL) ENGINEERING CONSULTANCY FRAMEWORK, MAINTAINING JACOBS' POSITION AS A KEY PROVIDER OF PROFESSIONAL SERVICES TO LONDON'S INTEGRATED TRANSPORT AUTHORITY."}